        "text": "Skip to main content\nK\nKel\nNew Chat\nWork\nProjects\nPermissions\nTranscription\nNo chat history\nWork & context\nSettings\nSkip to main content\nSet up Kel\n\nStep 2 of 5 · Providers\n\nSkip setup\nConnect a model\nOpen Providers\nClaude (Claude Code) \nQueued · ready, usage not reported\nCodex \nQueued · ready, usage not reported\nAnthropic API \nWaiting on you · needs you to sign in\nDeepSeek API \nWaiting on you · needs you to sign in\n\nKel can be explored without one, but answering and running jobs need a model: a CLI subscription, or an API key kept in Windows' protected store.\n\nBack\nNext",
