        "text": "Skip to main content\nK\nKel\nNew Chat\nWork\nProjects\nPermissions\nTranscription\nNo chat history\nWork & context\nSettings\nSkip to main content\nSet up Kel\n\nStep 3 of 5 · Project\n\nSkip setup\nWhere work happens\n\nKel is pointed at General. Nothing outside it is read or written unless you say yes when Kel asks.\n\nProjects are records, not copies — Files stay where you keep them.\n\nBack\nNext",
